<title>UK: Halifax ups UK mortage rates to 7.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Halifax ups UK mortage rates to 7.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Building Society said on Tuesday it was raising its UK mortgage rates to 7.6 percent from 7.25 percent.</p>
</text>
